# Input

```mdx
A long tag <Link   href='https://example.com/docs/getting-started'   target='_blank'   rel='noopener'>is formatted on one line</Link>.

- An item with <Card   title='A rather long title for the card'   description='And a long description too' />

An expression {a // with a line comment
} keeps its source.

- A tag that spans lines <Note
    type='tip' /> keeps its source.

{value // a block expression
}

```


# Formatted

```mdx
A long tag <Link href="https://example.com/docs/getting-started" target="_blank" rel="noopener">is formatted on one line</Link>.

- An item with <Card title="A rather long title for the card" description="And a long description too" />

An expression {a // with a line comment
} keeps its source.

- A tag that spans lines <Note
    type='tip' /> keeps its source.

{value // a block expression
}

```

# Lines exceeding max width of 80 characters
```
    1: A long tag <Link href="https://example.com/docs/getting-started" target="_blank" rel="noopener">is formatted on one line</Link>.
    3: - An item with <Card title="A rather long title for the card" description="And a long description too" />
```
